  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helmsley Charitable Trust (HCT) - - Mfundadzi Cooperative Livelihood Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Horticulture and Livestock).Beneficiaries: 628 farmers.Description: The farmers of Mfundadzi Farmers and Marketing Cooperative Society Limited will improve their capacity through trainings in aspects such as good management principles, crop production, livestock production, and climate-smart agriculture. They want to learn about nutritious foods and how to prepare them and establish irrigation demonstrations and also procure some livestock for demonstration.</narrative>
  </description>
